# 16. State Management

Pay particular attention to state synchronization between:

* Frontend
* Backend
* Active thread
* Message history
* Checkpoints
* Upload state
* AI generation state

Avoid situations where:

```text
Frontend says thread exists
but backend deleted it
```

or:

```text
Frontend shows old messages
but backend has newer state
```

or:

```text
Deleted thread reappears after refresh
```

The frontend and backend must remain synchronized.

